    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:d1bf136a4a3c936a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2e847ac385f19f0a5d57667610ee28cab839aedbbe2658dccd5083787be17c1a",
      "text": "Embark on a scenic panoramic bus journey along the Sun Route (Ruta del Sol), a beautiful route that takes you through the stunning Andean landscape. Along the way, enjoy picturesque views of the mountains, valleys, and traditional villages.\n\nDuring the journey, make stops at Raqchi, an ancient Incan archaeological site known for the Temple of Wiracocha, and Andahuaylillas, a charming village famous for its colonial-era church, often called the \"Sistine Chapel of the Andes\" due to its stunning interior artwork.\n\nAfter the stops, continue your journey to Cusco, arriving in the afternoon. This historic city, once the capital of the Inca Empire, will welcome you with its rich culture, stunning architecture, and vibrant atmosphere.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1IJ-ifZl_wfTwk-xMrqNJcO6OBMQunbcA",
        "documentSha256": "e72781a19f85cef319201422e08f82b1f3826c037805c98f97b2081b4eed559c",
